00:43:26.840 --> 00:43:31.000
And another thing to point out
and skip ahead here

00:43:31.000 --> 00:43:35.600
is that notice that
we ran down the three extensions

00:43:35.600 --> 00:43:39.600
and they're doing this
for each of the three data sets

00:43:39.600 --> 00:43:41.280
because this is a collection.

00:43:41.280 --> 00:43:44.640
The jobs run for...

00:43:44.640 --> 00:43:45.840
And every two execution runs

00:43:45.840 --> 00:43:47.560
for each
individual item in collection.

00:43:47.560 --> 00:43:50.840
So if you ever think,
"Wow, this is too much clicking

00:43:50.840 --> 00:43:53.880
in Galaxy,"
put things in a collection

00:43:53.880 --> 00:43:59.280
and everything will be done
for each and every collection.

00:43:59.280 --> 00:44:01.560
And it also automatically
keeps the name.

00:44:04.160 --> 00:44:05.760
So we can see for instance here.

00:44:05.760 --> 00:44:08.360
This is no extension
