00:52:30.720 --> 00:52:32.080
Alright.

00:52:33.880 --> 00:52:36.920
So this is the action.

00:52:36.920 --> 00:52:39.760
The next step
after the variant quality.

00:52:39.760 --> 00:52:42.200
So the variant quality
offers a BCF file,

00:52:42.200 --> 00:52:46.240
