00:54:54.400 --> 00:54:56.880
Okay.

00:54:56.880 --> 00:55:01.160
So that describes the effect
that the mutation has.

00:55:01.160 --> 00:55:07.080
And we can -- we can we can open
a BCF file now

00:55:07.080 --> 00:55:09.040
just to give you an idea
