00:55:38.680 --> 00:55:40.040
This is an option.

00:55:40.040 --> 00:55:44.400
[ Speaks indistinctly ]

00:55:44.400 --> 00:55:47.840
And then you have
various information.

00:55:47.840 --> 00:55:51.120
[ Speaks indistinctly ]

